        "query": "SELECT \n  b.id AS booking_id,\n  b.passenger_name,\n  b.passenger_email,\n  b.travel_class,\n  f.flight_number,\n  f.origin,\n  f.destination,\n  f.departure_time\nFROM bookings b\nJOIN flights f ON b.flight_id = f.id\nWHERE b.status = 'CONFIRMED'\nLIMIT 1;",
